  "tut.0": "Good morning, chef! You're in the depot kitchen. Walk with {moveforward}{moveleft}{moveback}{moveright} and look around with the mouse. Today you'll cook and sell your first pilaf.",
  "tut.1": "Look at the colander on the counter and pick it up with {interact}.",
  "tut.10": "Take the salt box and add salt: about 14 grams per kilo.",
  "tut.11": "Put the lid on the cauldron ({secondary}).",
  "tut.12": "The pilaf is absorbing the water. Watch its status by looking at the cauldron; explore the kitchen meanwhile.",
  "tut.13": "The water is absorbed! Turn off the heat ({secondary}) right away or it will burn.",
  "tut.14": "The pilaf is resting. Wait a few minutes; rested pilaf tastes better.",
  "tut.15": "Pick up the cauldron and place it in the cauldron slot of the cart by the door.",
  "tut.16": "Grab the cart handle with {interact} and push it out to the street. Press {interact} again to let go.",
  "tut.17": "Head to the school gate: the yellow marker guides you. Check the map with {phone}.",
  "tut.18": "Look at the cart and open for business with {interact}. Customers will start queueing.",
  "tut.19": "Read the order. Take a plate from the cart, scoop from the cauldron with {use}, then hand it over with {use}.",
  "tut.2": "With the colander in hand, look at the rice sack in the pantry and take at least 2 kg with {use}.",
  "tut.20": "The customer is paying. Pick the right change in the cash box and hand it over.",
  "tut.21": "Great! Manage prices on the board and stock on the depot laptop. Inspectors may show up at unlicensed spots: run with the cart!",
  "tut.22": "In the evening bring the cart back to the depot and sleep in the bed to end the day.",
  "tut.3": "Go to the sink, look at the tap and hold {interact} to wash the rice until the water runs clear.",
  "tut.4": "Put the colander down ({drop}). Pick up the big cauldron and place it on the cauldron burner.",
  "tut.5": "Look at the burner knob and turn on the heat with {interact}. {secondary} turns it down.",
  "tut.6": "Take butter from the fridge and add it to the cauldron with {use} (at least 100 g).",
  "tut.7": "While the butter melts, grab the washed rice and pour it into the cauldron ({use}).",
  "tut.8": "Hold {use} while looking at the cauldron to toast the rice. Done when the grains turn glossy.",
  "tut.9": "Fill the measuring jug at the tap and add water. Golden ratio: 1.5 litres per kg of rice.",
  "tut.title": "Guide {0}/{1}",
